  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add sliced onion and saute until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add bok choi and cook until wilted.",
    "Stir in berbere spice and smoked paprika.",
    "Squeeze lemon juice over the top and season with salt.",
    "Cover the skillet with a lid and steam for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with lemon wedges.",
    "Traditionally, ye beg alica is served with injera bread.",
    "To make it more authentic, wrap the bok choi mixture in injera bread before serving."
